# canvascraft_items.pdl - Canvas-Craft item table (PHASE 2, placeholder
# economy). CANVAS-CRAFT-DESIGN.md.
#
# One row per item that gets an explicit price and/or a starting stack
# in a fresh inventory. Any recipe id NOT listed here still shows up as
# craftable; its price falls back to a computed default in
# canvascraft_manager.c (primitive=1, subatomic=5, element=Z,
# compound=protons+neutrons) and its start count is 0.
#
# ITEM  | id              | price | start_count
------------------------------------------------
